## Arduino code example

```cpp
#include <Adafruit_NeoPixel.h>

#define LED_PIN 6

Adafruit_NeoPixel pixel(1, LED_PIN, NEO_GRB + NEO_KHZ800);

void setup() {
  pixel.begin();
  pixel.setPixelColor(0, pixel.Color(150, 0, 0)); // Red
  pixel.show();
}

void loop() {
  delay(100);
}
```

